Path-based operations re-resolve under authorized scope and bind object identity/handle/version to prevent stale pathname replacement races.

## PM-ERROR-001 — Safe Error Envelope

Production errors expose stable machine-readable code, disclosure-safe human message, diagnostic correlation ID, and separately authorized detail where applicable. Free-form backend text never controls logic.

## PM-LIMITATION-001 — Stable Limitation Codes

Machine-readable limitation codes, not human strings, control retry/safety/availability logic.

